---
import CarouselType0 from '@/components/CarouselEmbla/CarouselType0.svelte';
import CarouselType1 from '@/components/CarouselEmbla/CarouselType1.svelte';
import CarouselType2 from '@/components/CarouselEmbla/CarouselType2.svelte';
import CarouselType3 from '@/components/CarouselEmbla/CarouselType3.svelte';
---

<div class="sample-carousel" id="carousel">
  <div class="sample-carousel_inner">
    <h2>Carousel</h2>
    <h3>Type 0</h3>
    <p>最小限の設定。</p>
    <CarouselType0 client:load />
    <h3>Type 1</h3>
    <p>loopをtrue。自動でセンター表示。<br />表示数が3の場合、アイテムが5以上の時にloop。</p>
    <CarouselType1 client:load />
    <h3>Type 2</h3>
    <p>loopをtrue。自動でセンター表示。<br />画面幅いっぱいに表示。要素幅は固定。要素の数が少ないと成立せず。</p>
    <CarouselType2 client:load />
    <h3>Type 3</h3>
    <p>breakpointsでレイアウト切り替え。alignをカスタムし、PC時はコンテンツ幅で左揃え。</p>
    <CarouselType3 client:load />
  </div>
</div>

<style lang="scss">
  .sample-carousel {
    padding-block: var(--space-block);
    padding-inline: var(--space-inline);
  }

  .sample-carousel_inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1lh;
    max-width: var(--width-max);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .sample-carousel_full {
    width: 100vw;
    margin-inline: calc(50% - 50vw);
  }
</style>
